        <p class="text-2xl font-medium text-gray-900 mb-8 italic">
          Weight is the easy part. Every scale on this page reports it to a tenth or two of a
          pound, and a smart scale's real advantage for weight is that it logs every reading to your
          phone, so you see the trend instead of one morning's number. Body fat, muscle mass and
