          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">3. How We Chose These Smart Scales</h2>
<p>
            We have not tested these scales. They were chosen from maker product pages and manuals,
            Amazon listings, recall records and independent hands-on reviews — chiefly Tom's Guide's
